From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:21:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2272/3799] soh: rename func_80AB13D8 -> EnNb_IsNotCueAction

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: true when that cue channel is live and on any action other than the caller's
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c
index 1420f7124..5f981197b 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c
@@ -268,7 +268,8 @@ s32 EnNb_IsCueAction(EnNb* this, PlayState* play, u16 arg2, s32 npcActionIdx) {
     return false;
 }
 
-s32 func_80AB13D8(EnNb* this, PlayState* play, u16 arg2, s32 npcActionIdx) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AB13D8: true when that cue channel is live and on any action other than the caller's
+s32 EnNb_IsNotCueAction(EnNb* this, PlayState* play, u16 arg2, s32 npcActionIdx) {
     CsCmdActorCue* csCmdNPCAction;
 
     if ((play->csCtx.state != CS_STATE_IDLE) &&
@@ -515,7 +516,7 @@ void EnNb_CheckToFade(EnNb* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void EnNb_SetupLightOrb(EnNb* this, PlayState* play) {
-    if (func_80AB13D8(this, play, 4, 1)) {
+    if (EnNb_IsNotCueAction(this, play, 4, 1)) {  // was func_80AB13D8 [LLM:HIGH]
         this->action = NB_SEAL_HIDE;
         this->drawMode = NB_DRAW_HIDE;
         this->alphaTimer = kREG(5) + 10.0f;
